Squish bugs with your hands, stomp them mercilessly with your feet!<br>Sometimes, getting the job done means squishing bugs in one swipe with your hands and stomping them with your feet\u2014end for the bugs, relaxation for you!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/4c4ba668ecfa4dd5d3bb0e6a7e606033.poster.avif?t=1754489554\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/4c4ba668ecfa4dd5d3bb0e6a7e606033.webm?t=1754489554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/4c4ba668ecfa4dd5d3bb0e6a7e606033.mp4?t=1754489554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Chaotic missions, absurd humor, fun cleaning!<br>Ready for the craziest cleaning experience, solo or with your team!</p>",
